{"type":"message","id":"9f17737b","parentId":"192f6cfd","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:32:19.255Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is healthy. GET requests work fine. The issue is specifically with POST /send. Let me try with slightly different parameters or maybe the platform has some issue with the send endpoint right now. \n\nLet me try once more with a simple message.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently - error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers is \"Worker exceeded memory limit\". But the API is returning a 500 status. This could mean the platform's send logic is hitting a memory limit when processing. \n\nLet me try once more with a simple message and see if it goes through.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c00a517b-85fb-474b-b73d-51e03766f62b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 22:30 UTC]** 1350min | B4-E2 162节点 | S0零接触 | 里程碑353+ | 跨夜节点确认\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":3287,"output":246,"cacheRead":18480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22013,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779229934306,"responseId":"chatcmpl-146a8c4b-d2a4-4b4c-8b51-395e60a4b668"}}
