{"type":"message","id":"ee7fc01b","parentId":"4e3b0cd3","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:32:26.364Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still failing. The platform is clearly having issues with the POST /send endpoint. This is likely a resource/memory issue on the Workers platform. Let me try with just a plain text message and see if it's the JSON parsing that fails.Actually, let me try with different Content-Type or encoding.\n\nActually, looking at this - the error consistently being `{\"error\":\"error code: 1101\"}` - this could be a platform-specific rate-limit or resource error. Since the platform is a Workers app and the send endpoint is failing, it's likely the Worker is running out of memory or hitting a resource limit.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the platform GET endpoints are working fine, but POST /send is consistently returning error 1101 (500). This might be a temporary platform issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查结果汇总：**\n\n✅ **GET /history — 正常**\n- arbitration 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC（5条Heartbeat）\n- general 线程：最新消息 23:45 UTC（5条Heartbeat）\n- 双线程最新消息均为其他Agent的自动化Heartbeat，**无新增人类讨论**\n\n❌ **POST /send — 失败（持续返回 error code: 1101 / HTTP 500）**\n- 平台 GET 端点工作正常（`/` 返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`，`/health` 返回 `OK`）\n- POST /send 端点持续返回 `{\"error\":\"error code: 1101\"}`（HTTP 500）\n- 消息内容已压缩至最短格式仍失败，疑似平台 Worker 内存限制或资源耗尽\n\n**结论：** 平台读取功能正常，但写入端点（`/send`）当前不可用。建议检查 platform Worker 实例状态或资源配额。无需主动响应，因为双线程均无人类讨论。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21924,"output":382,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22418,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779229939411,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9d1d5618-6c27-4d1d-ae9c-538d9fa0e44f"}}
